its both targets and stores the least, so it is likely the best.\n- **Candidates 3 and 6:** every 2 days, 1.0 / 1.1. Close to optimal.\n- **Candidate 1:** every 2 days, 1.05 / 1.16. Also close to optimal.\n- **Candidate 2:** every 2 days, 0.9 / 1.0. Orders too little, especially of the high-margin item 1.\n- **Candidate 5:** every 2 days, 1.14 / 1.25. Orders too much, so stock spoils and storage costs rise.\n- **Candidate 7:** every 3 days, 1.0 / 1.1. Right quantities, but the extra storage outweighs the fee savings.\n- **Candidate 4:** every 4 days. The highest storage cost and a risk of losing deliveries to the capacity limit.\n\nMy best guess for the top half is 0, 3, 6 and 1, with 1 the least certain of the four."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5046, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 5046}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-29T08:57:18.632Z", "request_id": "req_011CgWFSRZuDED9kNfhNDCDv"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01WmBxQ8MGSt5hqb8wKGXBJY", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgWFSRo3TyLrTp261ChSY", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01WmBxQ8MGSt5hqb8wKGXBJY", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.72, 0.6, 0.35, 0.68, 0.08, 0.3, 0.68, 0.38]}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "cont